WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.419 --> 00:00:03.102
Unit fourteen. Cancer Prevention!

2
00:00:04.052 --> 00:00:07.528
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Visal, your school doctor.

3
00:00:07.578 --> 00:00:10.611
Hi, Doctor Visal! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:10.661 --> 00:00:14.040
Today we learn about Cancer Prevention. Let's go!

5
00:00:15.065 --> 00:00:18.148
Cancer. Say it with me. Cancer!

6
00:00:21.692 --> 00:00:25.009
Cells. Say it with me. Cells!

7
00:00:28.453 --> 00:00:31.869
Tobacco. Say it with me. Tobacco!

8
00:00:35.394 --> 00:00:38.611
Sun. Say it with me. Sun!

9
00:00:42.115 --> 00:00:47.181
HPV vaccine. Say it with me. HPV vaccine!

10
00:00:50.728 --> 00:00:53.828
Diet. Say it with me. Diet!

11
00:00:57.286 --> 00:01:00.370
Screening. Say it with me. Screening!

12
00:01:03.858 --> 00:01:07.874
Early detection. Say it with me. Early detection!

13
00:01:11.368 --> 00:01:21.587
Cancer happens when cells grow out of control. Avoiding tobacco, protecting skin from the sun, a healthy diet, and the HPV vaccine lower risk. Screening allows early detection.

14
00:01:21.636 --> 00:01:24.501
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Visal!

15
00:01:25.763 --> 00:01:30.809
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:30.859 --> 00:01:32.009
Tobacco!

17
00:01:32.957 --> 00:01:37.867
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:37.917 --> 00:01:39.050
Screening!

19
00:01:39.755 --> 00:01:45.320
Did you know? The HPV vaccine helps prevent cervical cancer and some other cancers!

20
00:01:45.370 --> 00:01:47.671
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:49.031 --> 00:01:56.752
Think and answer. How does the HPV vaccine help prevent cancer?

22
00:01:56.802 --> 00:01:57.952
Great answer!

23
00:01:58.978 --> 00:02:03.934
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:03.984 --> 00:02:06.636
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

